Runtime and build dependencies (as installed, see package.json files)

* TesterArmy e2e (https://github.com/tester-army/e2e) — Apache-2.0
  Optional driver and host integration (`@ai-bdd/driver-e2e`, `@ai-bdd/e2e-host`).
  Consumed as a dependency through e2e's public exports only: `e2e`,
  `e2e/agent`, `e2e/engine`, `e2e/runner`, and the `e2e mcp` CLI. No code copied.

* Cua Driver (https://github.com/trycua/cua) — MIT
  Optional driver integration (`@ai-bdd/driver-cua`) through the `cua-driver mcp`
  CLI and the typed contract tools. No code copied. The optional
  `cua-perception` extension (AGPL-3.0-only) is deliberately NOT a dependency.

* Gauge (https://github.com/getgauge/gauge) — Apache-2.0
  The Gauge markdown spec format is reimplemented from the published syntax
  documentation and parser behaviour. No Gauge code was copied, and ai-bdd is not
  a Gauge plugin.

* @cucumber/gherkin, @cucumber/messages, @cucumber/cucumber-expressions,
  @cucumber/tag-expressions, @cucumber/cucumber — MIT
* playwright-core — Apache-2.0
* zod — MIT
* fast-check — MIT
* pixelmatch — ISC
* fast-png — MIT
* commander — MIT
* @modelcontextprotocol/server, @modelcontextprotocol/client — MIT
* vitest, vite, esbuild, oxlint, typescript, tsx — MIT / Apache-2.0

